What's the most powerful pet anyone has ever had?  I picked up a dog
from a third-level ghost pile, and while saving my life several times,
it got up to 222 hp according to my stethoscope.

Unfortunately, the dog then stepped on a polymorph trap, turning into a
minotaur with 408 hp which attacked and killed everything in sight,
including several dragons and my temple priest.  It finally had about
450 hp when it died on a land mine.  I'm glad I didn't need to abandon
it and then find it again on the way back up.


